A thread with units joins the spare or spent queue without bringing the release forward.
The kernel would look for it too late, and the thread wait past the count its virtual time came within a span of;
a thread with units that waits without time has its virtual time no earlier than a span past the release.

Caught-by: fuzz fuzz-pmp8 fuzz-rp2350 fuzz-smp2 fuzz-work test qemu-replay
Report: a lender's virtual time comes before the release
Report: a place's virtual time comes before the release
Witness: fuzz lend-own-time-comes

